    "identifier": "water-release-whisper",
    "description": "<p>You send bubbles made from Water Release chakra to fill the inner ear of your allies for the duration.</p>\n<p>All willing creatures within range can gain the benefits of this jutsu for the duration. Affected creatures who would make a Wisdom (Perception) gain a rank of mastery to this Check. Additionally, sound based environmental effects and Genjutsu with the Auditory keyword that force a saving throw of any type are made with a rank of mastery added to the saving throw.</p>",
